ants (2.6.5-1~noble1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian/NeuroDebian packaging (ported from the neurofedora
    ANTs.spec). Not in Debian, Ubuntu or NeuroDebian.
  * Build against the system InsightToolkit5 5.4.6 (ANTS_SUPERBUILD=OFF,
    USE_SYSTEM_ITK=ON, ITK_DIR=.../cmake/ITK-5.4) — no superbuild downloads.
  * C++17 + -fpermissive for older ANTs code on current GCC.
  * Patch antsUtilities to carry SOVERSION 1; ship the internal
    l_*/antsUtilities runtime libraries and the upstream Scripts/ under
    /usr/share/ants/scripts.

